      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by: renaming the test method to describe its intent (`test_roundTripConversionFromInstantAndVerifyModifiedJulianDay`), extracting the magic number `56702L` into a named constant `MOCKED_NOW_MJD` with a comment explaining the corresponding calendar date, removing unused imports (`StringWriter`, `Duration`), and adding inline comments that explain both assertions."
